480..555 Comment "/// The buffer placed in a handler\'s region and submitted, with the handler"
556..629 Comment "/// ending before the completion is reaped. Refused today at the fork: an"
630..702 Comment "/// endpoint inside a handler\'s scope could be resumed twice. The buffer"
703..779 Comment "/// belongs in a hold\'s region, which a fork outside any handler can live in"
780..792 Comment "/// (#1220)."
